WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:05.690
In Vienna, your product list shows its
search placeholder and badges in English.

2
00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:10.170
The placeholder is an attribute,
and the badges come from a constant.

3
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:15.760
General Translation translates
placeholders with useGT and constants with

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.990
msg and useMessages.

5
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:23.130
Call useGT, and pass the placeholder
to the function it returns.

6
00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:28.870
In async components, await getGT,
because they cannot use hooks.

7
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:32.579
For constants, msg registers each string,

8
00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:35.590
and useMessages resolves
it where you render it.

9
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:41.530
Run npx gt translate to write the
Spanish, Japanese and German strings.

10
00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:45.550
In Vienna, the placeholder and
the badges now read in German.
